How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video.

integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Continuous shot at floor level in the dark pump room. The camera stays still. Start exactly at Picture 1. The young woman in the foreground, rifle held low and pointed at the floor, shuffles a little closer to the old scientist in a crouch. He slowly lifts his head toward her, his eyes heavy, and a faint crooked smile spreads across his face; his lips move slightly as he murmurs a few weak words in Japanese. He does not get up. No blood, no wound visible. No text appears. Keep the dark blue-green industrial color grade.

overall_soundscape: The low hum of machinery, her careful footsteps and breathing through the respirator, his weak, rasping murmur.

non_diegetic_music: N/A
